backend/hltb_endpoint_discovery.lua, backend/hltb_client.lua,
backend/hltb_match.lua, and backend/hltb_utils.lua are substantially
ported from hltb-millennium-plugin (https://github.com/jcdoll/hltb-millennium-plugin):

MIT License
Copyright (c) 2025 Joey Doll

frontend/lib/patchLibraryApp.tsx's game-detail badge injection technique
is adapted from patterns documented in SteamHunter-plugin
(https://github.com/BossSloth/SteamHunter-plugin):

MIT License
Copyright (c) 2026 BossSloth

Feature design and behavior throughout this project are ported from
Deck Progress Tracker (https://github.com/maroun2/deck-progress-tracker),
BSD-3-Clause licensed, Copyright (c) 2025 Maron -- no source code from
that project is directly reused, only its feature specification and
UI/UX design, per PORTING_PLAN.md.
